--- !u!114 &114251942520190415
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1028606785578569}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1271
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 虽说事先已被你破去一角，但你竟能在此等阵法的加持下击败冲虚散人，还真是让我惊讶，不愧让我看好你这么多年，嘻嘻。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114403786171211455}
  AvatarIntID: 1
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114966509763621479
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1028606785578569}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1251
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 哼，还不是被冲虚散人摆了一道。那阵法应该是出自古神教，专用于克制神魂一道的修士，不但要多位元婴修士为阵基，还内合奇门八卦之形，竟能内蕴一个小的阵法空间。若不是你击杀了作为阵眼的冲虚散人，只怕是要我亲至阵法外才能发觉。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114403786171211455}
  AvatarIntID: 1
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114463309073572635
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1028606785578569}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1230
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 啊，对了，几大魔教最近动作不小，你在外游历时多加小心，我感觉，他们可能会冲着你来。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114403786171211455}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
